{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Global Domination\u2014Ball Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is divided, and the map is yours to redraw. Step into the round shoes of your favorite Countryball and take on the ultimate mission: conquer and unite all 195 countries. Whether through brute force or clever diplomacy, it\u2019s time to roll your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Income Per Second \u2013 Build Your Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i>, time is money\u2014literally. Your income grows every second. Upgrade your industries, improve trade, and manage global assets to fuel your expansion. The more countries you control, the faster your economy booms. Smart decisions lead to stronger domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>War or Influence \u2013 You Decide</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s more than one way to rule the world:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Conquer with Force</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train cartoonish armies, deploy tanks, fighter jets, submarines, rocket systems, and\u2014when diplomacy fails\u2014unleash nukes. Dominate the battlefield with over-the-top firepower, all wrapped in the classic Countryballs humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Control with Influence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spread your faith across borders and watch nations fall under your spiritual sway. Use religion as your tool of power\u2014convert hearts, reshape ideologies, and unite the world without firing a single shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Your Goal: Total World Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No peace treaties. No second chances. Only one Countryball can rise as the supreme global ruler. Will you win through fear, friendship, or pure strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude02 <strong>A Strategy Game That Doesn\u2019t Take Itself Too Seriously</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i> is a unique blend of grand strategy and idle mechanics, packed with humor, history, and absurd international antics. It\u2019s the world conquest game where even the smallest Countryball can redraw the map\u2014with enough upgrades and attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of over 195 unique countryballs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your income and economy in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance war, influence, and diplomacy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Countryball comes with its own unique look and national attitude\u2014no customization needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Laugh (or cry) as world events spiral into madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for both serious strategy fans and meme lovers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Add <i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i> to your Wishlist and get ready to take over the world\u2014diplomacy optional!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3780060?t=1748636539","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3780060?t=1748636539","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/db08368ae95f8911f4425eff9a1be816f811d188/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748636539","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/db08368ae95f8911f4425eff9a1be816f811d188/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748636539","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Global Domination\u2014Ball Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is divided, and the map is yours to redraw. Step into the round shoes of your favorite Countryball and take on the ultimate mission: conquer and unite all 195 countries. Whether through brute force or clever diplomacy, it\u2019s time to roll your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Income Per Second \u2013 Build Your Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i>, time is money\u2014literally. Your income grows every second. Upgrade your industries, improve trade, and manage global assets to fuel your expansion. The more countries you control, the faster your economy booms. Smart decisions lead to stronger domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>War or Influence \u2013 You Decide</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s more than one way to rule the world:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Conquer with Force</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train cartoonish armies, deploy tanks, fighter jets, submarines, rocket systems, and\u2014when diplomacy fails\u2014unleash nukes. Dominate the battlefield with over-the-top firepower, all wrapped in the classic Countryballs humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Control with Influence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spread your faith across borders and watch nations fall under your spiritual sway. Use religion as your tool of power\u2014convert hearts, reshape ideologies, and unite the world without firing a single shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Your Goal: Total World Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No peace treaties. No second chances. Only one Countryball can rise as the supreme global ruler. Will you win through fear, friendship, or pure strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude02 <strong>A Strategy Game That Doesn\u2019t Take Itself Too Seriously</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i> is a unique blend of grand strategy and idle mechanics, packed with humor, history, and absurd international antics. It\u2019s the world conquest game where even the smallest Countryball can redraw the map\u2014with enough upgrades and attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of over 195 unique countryballs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your income and economy in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance war, influence, and diplomacy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Countryball comes with its own unique look and national attitude\u2014no customization needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Laugh (or cry) as world events spiral into madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for both serious strategy fans and meme lovers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Add <i>Countryballs: Power Protocol</i> to your Wishlist and get ready to take over the world\u2014diplomacy optional!</p>","developers":["KNK DEVELOP"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780060/6f27fdfa43667b35dff5011241f23a7b272ff1c0/header.jpg?t=1748636539","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong